    "detailed_description": "In the first-person single-player game USS Tempest: Spaceship Simulator you take a journey through the stars and experience the ultimate mission of leading the fate of the spaceship and the crew. Set course to known space and gather the necessary resources to keep the ship running. Along the way, you will explore different events and planets.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/1dfab09eefdf9dadad616a9344554919.poster.avif?t=1736719312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/1dfab09eefdf9dadad616a9344554919.webm?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/1dfab09eefdf9dadad616a9344554919.mp4?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Experience first-person shooter action and puzzles in the story missions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/8ac1949d1c7f3af13c02b93f8fb5de18.poster.avif?t=1736719312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/8ac1949d1c7f3af13c02b93f8fb5de18.webm?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/8ac1949d1c7f3af13c02b93f8fb5de18.mp4?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Encounter different randomized situations onboard the ship.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/107bfd1a1e3d2da2fbbb8e9345401068.poster.avif?t=1736719312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/107bfd1a1e3d2da2fbbb8e9345401068.webm?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/107bfd1a1e3d2da2fbbb8e9345401068.mp4?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>If you allow visitors to explore your ship or services, you will have the chance to gather additional resources or to recruit them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/502824d01d9cd95e41135f39a6d8cb7e.poster.avif?t=1736719312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/502824d01d9cd95e41135f39a6d8cb7e.webm?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/502824d01d9cd95e41135f39a6d8cb7e.mp4?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Space is a dangerous place! System failures, Hostile Environments, Attacks\u2026 Be prepared and invest in defense mechanisms.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/b62c282a0f3e40abd5ea8f7e033d4c90.poster.avif?t=1736719312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/b62c282a0f3e40abd5ea8f7e033d4c90.webm?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/b62c282a0f3e40abd5ea8f7e033d4c90.mp4?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Grow plants, upgrade the existing systems and establish new services to attract visitors. Do everything necessary to make your life easier!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Fight your way back home</strong> - Peacefully or with violence<br></li><li> <strong>Survive</strong>- Trade, maintain the ship and upgrade the systems<br></li><li> <strong>Explore</strong> - Events, Unknown Space and the USS Tempest</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "In the first-person single-player game USS Tempest: Spaceship Simulator you take a journey through the stars and experience the ultimate mission of leading the fate of the spaceship and the crew. Set course to known space and gather the necessary resources to keep the ship running. Along the way, you will explore different events and planets.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/1dfab09eefdf9dadad616a9344554919.poster.avif?t=1736719312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/1dfab09eefdf9dadad616a9344554919.webm?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/1dfab09eefdf9dadad616a9344554919.mp4?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Experience first-person shooter action and puzzles in the story missions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/8ac1949d1c7f3af13c02b93f8fb5de18.poster.avif?t=1736719312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/8ac1949d1c7f3af13c02b93f8fb5de18.webm?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/8ac1949d1c7f3af13c02b93f8fb5de18.mp4?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Encounter different randomized situations onboard the ship.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/107bfd1a1e3d2da2fbbb8e9345401068.poster.avif?t=1736719312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/107bfd1a1e3d2da2fbbb8e9345401068.webm?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/107bfd1a1e3d2da2fbbb8e9345401068.mp4?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>If you allow visitors to explore your ship or services, you will have the chance to gather additional resources or to recruit them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/502824d01d9cd95e41135f39a6d8cb7e.poster.avif?t=1736719312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/502824d01d9cd95e41135f39a6d8cb7e.webm?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/502824d01d9cd95e41135f39a6d8cb7e.mp4?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Space is a dangerous place! System failures, Hostile Environments, Attacks\u2026 Be prepared and invest in defense mechanisms.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/b62c282a0f3e40abd5ea8f7e033d4c90.poster.avif?t=1736719312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/b62c282a0f3e40abd5ea8f7e033d4c90.webm?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831540/extras/b62c282a0f3e40abd5ea8f7e033d4c90.mp4?t=1736719312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Grow plants, upgrade the existing systems and establish new services to attract visitors. Do everything necessary to make your life easier!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Fight your way back home</strong> - Peacefully or with violence<br></li><li> <strong>Survive</strong>- Trade, maintain the ship and upgrade the systems<br></li><li> <strong>Explore</strong> - Events, Unknown Space and the USS Tempest</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Crewman, you are lost in deep space and threats are lurking everywhere. Survive and bring you and your allies back to known space. It's in your hands!",
